        <item>
            <title><![CDATA[将 Docusaurus 网站部署到 GitHub Pages]]></title>
            <link>https://yuwl.github.io/blog/deploy-docusaurus-to-github-pages</link>
            <guid>https://yuwl.github.io/blog/deploy-docusaurus-to-github-pages</guid>
            <pubDate>Thu, 14 May 2026 00:00:00 GMT</pubDate>
            <description><![CDATA[本文记录将 Docusaurus 网站部署到 GitHub Pages 的完整过程，包括 Git 多账号配置、SSH 认证、以及源码与部署分支分离的最佳实践。]]></description>
            <content:encoded><![CDATA[<p>本文记录将 Docusaurus 网站部署到 GitHub Pages 的完整过程，包括 Git 多账号配置、SSH 认证、以及源码与部署分支分离的最佳实践。</p>
<h2 class="anchor anchorWithStickyNavbar_LWe7" id="准备工作">准备工作<a href="https://yuwl.github.io/blog/deploy-docusaurus-to-github-pages#%E5%87%86%E5%A4%87%E5%B7%A5%E4%BD%9C" class="hash-link" aria-label="准备工作的直接链接" title="准备工作的直接链接">​</a></h2>
<h3 class="anchor anchorWithStickyNavbar_LWe7" id="1-修改-docusaurusconfigjs">1. 修改 docusaurus.config.js<a href="https://yuwl.github.io/blog/deploy-docusaurus-to-github-pages#1-%E4%BF%AE%E6%94%B9-docusaurusconfigjs" class="hash-link" aria-label="1. 修改 docusaurus.config.js的直接链接" title="1. 修改 docusaurus.config.js的直接链接">​</a></h3>
<p>确保以下字段配置正确：</p>
<div class="language-js codeBlockContainer_Ckt0 theme-code-block" style="--prism-color:#393A34;--prism-background-color:#f6f8fa"><div class="codeBlockContent_biex"><pre tabindex="0" class="prism-code language-js codeBlock_bY9V thin-scrollbar" style="color:#393A34;background-color:#f6f8fa"><code class="codeBlockLines_e6Vv"><span class="token-line" style="color:#393A34"><span class="token literal-property property" style="color:#36acaa">url</span><span class="token operator" style="color:#393A34">:</span><span class="token plain"> </span><span class="token string" style="color:#e3116c">'https://yuwl.github.io/'</span><span class="token punctuation" style="color:#393A34">,</span><span class="token plain"></span><br></span><span class="token-line" style="color:#393A34"><span class="token plain"></span><span class="token literal-property property" style="color:#36acaa">baseUrl</span><span class="token operator" style="color:#393A34">:</span><span class="token plain"> </span><span class="token string" style="color:#e3116c">'/'</span><span class="token punctuation" style="color:#393A34">,</span><span class="token plain">                        </span><span class="token comment" style="color:#999988;font-style:italic">// User Site 用 /，Project Site 用 /仓库名/</span><span class="token plain"></span><br></span><span class="token-line" style="color:#393A34"><span class="token plain"></span><span class="token literal-property property" style="color:#36acaa">organizationName</span><span class="token operator" style="color:#393A34">:</span><span class="token plain"> </span><span class="token string" style="color:#e3116c">'yuwl'</span><span class="token punctuation" style="color:#393A34">,</span><span class="token plain">            </span><span class="token comment" style="color:#999988;font-style:italic">// GitHub 用户名</span><span class="token plain"></span><br></span><span class="token-line" style="color:#393A34"><span class="token plain"></span><span class="token literal-property property" style="color:#36acaa">projectName</span><span class="token operator" style="color:#393A34">:</span><span class="token plain"> </span><span class="token string" style="color:#e3116c">'yuwl.github.io'</span><span class="token punctuation" style="color:#393A34">,</span><span class="token plain">       </span><span class="token comment" style="color:#999988;font-style:italic">// 仓库名</span><span class="token plain"></span><br></span><span class="token-line" style="color:#393A34"><span class="token plain"></span><span class="token literal-property property" style="color:#36acaa">deploymentBranch</span><span class="token operator" style="color:#393A34">:</span><span class="token plain"> </span><span class="token string" style="color:#e3116c">'gh-pages'</span><span class="token punctuation" style="color:#393A34">,</span><span class="token plain">        </span><span class="token comment" style="color:#999988;font-style:italic">// 部署目标分支</span><br></span></code></pre><div class="buttonGroup__atx"><button type="button" aria-label="复制代码到剪贴板" title="复制" class="clean-btn"><span class="copyButtonIcons_eSgA" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" class="copyButtonIcon_y97N"><path fill="currentColor" d="M19,21H8V7H19M19,5H8A2,2 0 0,0 6,7V21A2,2 0 0,0 8,23H19A2,2 0 0,0 21,21V7A2,2 0 0,0 19,5M16,1H4A2,2 0 0,0 2,3V17H4V3H16V1Z"></path></svg><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" class="copyButtonSuccessIcon_LjdS"><path fill="currentColor" d="M21,7L9,19L3.5,13.5L4.91,12.09L9,16.17L19.59,5.59L21,7Z"></path></svg></span></button></div></div></div>
<blockquote>
<p><strong>User Site vs Project Site</strong></p>
<ul>
<li>仓库名为 <code>&lt;username&gt;.github.io</code> → User Site，<code>baseUrl: '/'</code></li>
<li>普通仓库（如 <code>my-blog</code>）→ Project Site，<code>baseUrl: '/my-blog/'</code></li>
</ul>
</blockquote>
<h3 class="anchor anchorWithStickyNavbar_LWe7" id="2-确认-gitignore">2. 确认 .gitignore<a href="https://yuwl.github.io/blog/deploy-docusaurus-to-github-pages#2-%E7%A1%AE%E8%AE%A4-gitignore" class="hash-link" aria-label="2. 确认 .gitignore的直接链接" title="2. 确认 .gitignore的直接链接">​</a></h3>
<p>Docusaurus 项目默认已包含 <code>.gitignore</code>，会排除以下内容，无需手动配置：</p>
<div class="codeBlockContainer_Ckt0 theme-code-block" style="--prism-color:#393A34;--prism-background-color:#f6f8fa"><div class="codeBlockContent_biex"><pre tabindex="0" class="prism-code language-text codeBlock_bY9V thin-scrollbar" style="color:#393A34;background-color:#f6f8fa"><code class="codeBlockLines_e6Vv"><span class="token-line" style="color:#393A34"><span class="token plain">node_modules/   # 依赖包</span><br></span><span class="token-line" style="color:#393A34"><span class="token plain">build/          # 打包产物（deploy 命令会自动处理）</span><br></span><span class="token-line" style="color:#393A34"><span class="token plain">.docusaurus/    # 缓存文件</span><br></span></code></pre><div class="buttonGroup__atx"><button type="button" aria-label="复制代码到剪贴板" title="复制" class="clean-btn"><span class="copyButtonIcons_eSgA" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" class="copyButtonIcon_y97N"><path fill="currentColor" d="M19,21H8V7H19M19,5H8A2,2 0 0,0 6,7V21A2,2 0 0,0 8,23H19A2,2 0 0,0 21,21V7A2,2 0 0,0 19,5M16,1H4A2,2 0 0,0 2,3V17H4V3H16V1Z"></path></svg><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" class="copyButtonSuccessIcon_LjdS"><path fill="currentColor" d="M21,7L9,19L3.5,13.5L4.91,12.09L9,16.17L19.59,5.59L21,7Z"></path></svg></span></button></div></div></div>
<hr>
<h2 class="anchor anchorWithStickyNavbar_LWe7" id="git-配置多账号环境">Git 配置（多账号环境）<a href="https://yuwl.github.io/blog/deploy-docusaurus-to-github-pages#git-%E9%85%8D%E7%BD%AE%E5%A4%9A%E8%B4%A6%E5%8F%B7%E7%8E%AF%E5%A2%83" class="hash-link" aria-label="Git 配置（多账号环境）的直接链接" title="Git 配置（多账号环境）的直接链接">​</a></h2>
<p>如果本机已有公司 Git 账号的全局配置，只需在本项目中设置<strong>局部配置</strong>，不影响全局：</p>
<div class="language-powershell codeBlockContainer_Ckt0 theme-code-block" style="--prism-color:#393A34;--prism-background-color:#f6f8fa"><div class="codeBlockContent_biex"><pre tabindex="0" class="prism-code language-powershell codeBlock_bY9V thin-scrollbar" style="color:#393A34;background-color:#f6f8fa"><code class="codeBlockLines_e6Vv"><span class="token-line" style="color:#393A34"><span class="token plain">git init</span><br></span><span class="token-line" style="color:#393A34"><span class="token plain">git config user.name "yuwl"</span><br></span><span class="token-line" style="color:#393A34"><span class="token plain">git config user.email "你的GitHub邮箱"</span><br></span></code></pre><div class="buttonGroup__atx"><button type="button" aria-label="复制代码到剪贴板" title="复制" class="clean-btn"><span class="copyButtonIcons_eSgA" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" class="copyButtonIcon_y97N"><path fill="currentColor" d="M19,21H8V7H19M19,5H8A2,2 0 0,0 6,7V21A2,2 0 0,0 8,23H19A2,2 0 0,0 21,21V7A2,2 0 0,0 19,5M16,1H4A2,2 0 0,0 2,3V17H4V3H16V1Z"></path></svg><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" class="copyButtonSuccessIcon_LjdS"><path fill="currentColor" d="M21,7L9,19L3.5,13.5L4.91,12.09L9,16.17L19.59,5.59L21,7Z"></path></svg></span></button></div></div></div>
<p>不加 <code>--global</code> 的配置只对当前项目生效，局部配置优先级高于全局配置。</p>
<h3 class="anchor anchorWithStickyNavbar_LWe7" id="查看配置">查看配置<a href="https://yuwl.github.io/blog/deploy-docusaurus-to-github-pages#%E6%9F%A5%E7%9C%8B%E9%85%8D%E7%BD%AE" class="hash-link" aria-label="查看配置的直接链接" title="查看配置的直接链接">​</a></h3>
<div class="language-powershell codeBlockContainer_Ckt0 theme-code-block" style="--prism-color:#393A34;--prism-background-color:#f6f8fa"><div class="codeBlockContent_biex"><pre tabindex="0" class="prism-code language-powershell codeBlock_bY9V thin-scrollbar" style="color:#393A34;background-color:#f6f8fa"><code class="codeBlockLines_e6Vv"><span class="token-line" style="color:#393A34"><span class="token plain"># 查看全局配置</span><br></span><span class="token-line" style="color:#393A34"><span class="token plain">git config --global --list</span><br></span><span class="token-line" style="color:#393A34"><span class="token plain" style="display:inline-block"></span><br></span><span class="token-line" style="color:#393A34"><span class="token plain"># 查看当前项目配置</span><br></span><span class="token-line" style="color:#393A34"><span class="token plain">git config --local --list</span><br></span><span class="token-line" style="color:#393A34"><span class="token plain" style="display:inline-block"></span><br></span><span class="token-line" style="color:#393A34"><span class="token plain"># 查看最终生效的配置</span><br></span><span class="token-line" style="color:#393A34"><span class="token plain">git config --list</span><br></span></code></pre><div class="buttonGroup__atx"><button type="button" aria-label="复制代码到剪贴板" title="复制" class="clean-btn"><span class="copyButtonIcons_eSgA" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" class="copyButtonIcon_y97N"><path fill="currentColor" d="M19,21H8V7H19M19,5H8A2,2 0 0,0 6,7V21A2,2 0 0,0 8,23H19A2,2 0 0,0 21,21V7A2,2 0 0,0 19,5M16,1H4A2,2 0 0,0 2,3V17H4V3H16V1Z"></path></svg><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" class="copyButtonSuccessIcon_LjdS"><path fill="currentColor" d="M21,7L9,19L3.5,13.5L4.91,12.09L9,16.17L19.59,5.59L21,7Z"></path></svg></span></button></div></div></div>
<hr>
<h2 class="anchor anchorWithStickyNavbar_LWe7" id="配置代理可选">配置代理（可选）<a href="https://yuwl.github.io/blog/deploy-docusaurus-to-github-pages#%E9%85%8D%E7%BD%AE%E4%BB%A3%E7%90%86%E5%8F%AF%E9%80%89" class="hash-link" aria-label="配置代理（可选）的直接链接" title="配置代理（可选）的直接链接">​</a></h2>
<p>如需翻墙访问 GitHub，可只为本项目设置局部代理：</p>
<div class="language-powershell codeBlockContainer_Ckt0 theme-code-block" style="--prism-color:#393A34;--prism-background-color:#f6f8fa"><div class="codeBlockContent_biex"><pre tabindex="0" class="prism-code language-powershell codeBlock_bY9V thin-scrollbar" style="color:#393A34;background-color:#f6f8fa"><code class="codeBlockLines_e6Vv"><span class="token-line" style="color:#393A34"><span class="token plain">git config http.proxy http://127.0.0.1:7890</span><br></span><span class="token-line" style="color:#393A34"><span class="token plain">git config https.proxy http://127.0.0.1:7890</span><br></span></code></pre><div class="buttonGroup__atx"><button type="button" aria-label="复制代码到剪贴板" title="复制" class="clean-btn"><span class="copyButtonIcons_eSgA" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" class="copyButtonIcon_y97N"><path fill="currentColor" d="M19,21H8V7H19M19,5H8A2,2 0 0,0 6,7V21A2,2 0 0,0 8,23H19A2,2 0 0,0 21,21V7A2,2 0 0,0 19,5M16,1H4A2,2 0 0,0 2,3V17H4V3H16V1Z"></path></svg><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" class="copyButtonSuccessIcon_LjdS"><path fill="currentColor" d="M21,7L9,19L3.5,13.5L4.91,12.09L9,16.17L19.59,5.59L21,7Z"></path></svg></span></button></div></div></div>
<p>同样不加 <code>--global</code>，只对当前项目生效。</p>
<hr>
<h2 class="anchor anchorWithStickyNavbar_LWe7" id="推送源码到远程仓库">推送源码到远程仓库<a href="https://yuwl.github.io/blog/deploy-docusaurus-to-github-pages#%E6%8E%A8%E9%80%81%E6%BA%90%E7%A0%81%E5%88%B0%E8%BF%9C%E7%A8%8B%E4%BB%93%E5%BA%93" class="hash-link" aria-label="推送源码到远程仓库的直接链接" title="推送源码到远程仓库的直接链接">​</a></h2>
<p>由于远程仓库 <code>master</code> 分支已有旧内容，为避免覆盖，将 Docusaurus 源码推送到新分支 <code>docusaurus</code>：</p>
<div class="language-powershell codeBlockContainer_Ckt0 theme-code-block" style="--prism-color:#393A34;--prism-background-color:#f6f8fa"><div class="codeBlockContent_biex"><pre tabindex="0" class="prism-code language-powershell codeBlock_bY9V thin-scrollbar" style="color:#393A34;background-color:#f6f8fa"><code class="codeBlockLines_e6Vv"><span class="token-line" style="color:#393A34"><span class="token plain">git add .</span><br></span><span class="token-line" style="color:#393A34"><span class="token plain">git commit -m "init: docusaurus site"</span><br></span><span class="token-line" style="color:#393A34"><span class="token plain">git remote add origin git@github.com:yuwl/yuwl.github.io.git</span><br></span><span class="token-line" style="color:#393A34"><span class="token plain" style="display:inline-block"></span><br></span><span class="token-line" style="color:#393A34"><span class="token plain"># 推送到新分支，不影响 master</span><br></span><span class="token-line" style="color:#393A34"><span class="token plain">git push -u origin master:docusaurus</span><br></span></code></pre><div class="buttonGroup__atx"><button type="button" aria-label="复制代码到剪贴板" title="复制" class="clean-btn"><span class="copyButtonIcons_eSgA" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" class="copyButtonIcon_y97N"><path fill="currentColor" d="M19,21H8V7H19M19,5H8A2,2 0 0,0 6,7V21A2,2 0 0,0 8,23H19A2,2 0 0,0 21,21V7A2,2 0 0,0 19,5M16,1H4A2,2 0 0,0 2,3V17H4V3H16V1Z"></path></svg><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" class="copyButtonSuccessIcon_LjdS"><path fill="currentColor" d="M21,7L9,19L3.5,13.5L4.91,12.09L9,16.17L19.59,5.59L21,7Z"></path></svg></span></button></div></div></div>
<p>这样远程分支结构为：</p>
<ul>
<li><code>master</code> — 旧内容（保留）</li>
<li><code>docusaurus</code> — Docusaurus 源码备份</li>
<li><code>gh-pages</code> — 部署后自动创建，存放打包后的静态文件</li>
</ul>
<hr>
<h2 class="anchor anchorWithStickyNavbar_LWe7" id="配置-ssh-认证">配置 SSH 认证<a href="https://yuwl.github.io/blog/deploy-docusaurus-to-github-pages#%E9%85%8D%E7%BD%AE-ssh-%E8%AE%A4%E8%AF%81" class="hash-link" aria-label="配置 SSH 认证的直接链接" title="配置 SSH 认证的直接链接">​</a></h2>
<p>GitHub 已不支持密码方式推送，推荐使用 SSH。</p>
<h3 class="anchor anchorWithStickyNavbar_LWe7" id="1-检查是否已有-ssh-key">1. 检查是否已有 SSH key<a href="https://yuwl.github.io/blog/deploy-docusaurus-to-github-pages#1-%E6%A3%80%E6%9F%A5%E6%98%AF%E5%90%A6%E5%B7%B2%E6%9C%89-ssh-key" class="hash-link" aria-label="1. 检查是否已有 SSH key的直接链接" title="1. 检查是否已有 SSH key的直接链接">​</a></h3>
<div class="language-powershell codeBlockContainer_Ckt0 theme-code-block" style="--prism-color:#393A34;--prism-background-color:#f6f8fa"><div class="codeBlockContent_biex"><pre tabindex="0" class="prism-code language-powershell codeBlock_bY9V thin-scrollbar" style="color:#393A34;background-color:#f6f8fa"><code class="codeBlockLines_e6Vv"><span class="token-line" style="color:#393A34"><span class="token plain">ls ~/.ssh</span><br></span></code></pre><div class="buttonGroup__atx"><button type="button" aria-label="复制代码到剪贴板" title="复制" class="clean-btn"><span class="copyButtonIcons_eSgA" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" class="copyButtonIcon_y97N"><path fill="currentColor" d="M19,21H8V7H19M19,5H8A2,2 0 0,0 6,7V21A2,2 0 0,0 8,23H19A2,2 0 0,0 21,21V7A2,2 0 0,0 19,5M16,1H4A2,2 0 0,0 2,3V17H4V3H16V1Z"></path></svg><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" class="copyButtonSuccessIcon_LjdS"><path fill="currentColor" d="M21,7L9,19L3.5,13.5L4.91,12.09L9,16.17L19.59,5.59L21,7Z"></path></svg></span></button></div></div></div>
<p>如果已有 <code>id_ed25519.pub</code> 或 <code>id_rsa.pub</code> 可跳过下一步。</p>
<h3 class="anchor anchorWithStickyNavbar_LWe7" id="2-生成-ssh-key">2. 生成 SSH key<a href="https://yuwl.github.io/blog/deploy-docusaurus-to-github-pages#2-%E7%94%9F%E6%88%90-ssh-key" class="hash-link" aria-label="2. 生成 SSH key的直接链接" title="2. 生成 SSH key的直接链接">​</a></h3>
<div class="language-powershell codeBlockContainer_Ckt0 theme-code-block" style="--prism-color:#393A34;--prism-background-color:#f6f8fa"><div class="codeBlockContent_biex"><pre tabindex="0" class="prism-code language-powershell codeBlock_bY9V thin-scrollbar" style="color:#393A34;background-color:#f6f8fa"><code class="codeBlockLines_e6Vv"><span class="token-line" style="color:#393A34"><span class="token plain">ssh-keygen -t ed25519 -C "你的GitHub邮箱"</span><br></span></code></pre><div class="buttonGroup__atx"><button type="button" aria-label="复制代码到剪贴板" title="复制" class="clean-btn"><span class="copyButtonIcons_eSgA" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" class="copyButtonIcon_y97N"><path fill="currentColor" d="M19,21H8V7H19M19,5H8A2,2 0 0,0 6,7V21A2,2 0 0,0 8,23H19A2,2 0 0,0 21,21V7A2,2 0 0,0 19,5M16,1H4A2,2 0 0,0 2,3V17H4V3H16V1Z"></path></svg><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" class="copyButtonSuccessIcon_LjdS"><path fill="currentColor" d="M21,7L9,19L3.5,13.5L4.91,12.09L9,16.17L19.59,5.59L21,7Z"></path></svg></span></button></div></div></div>
<p>一路回车即可。<code>-t ed25519</code> 指定使用 Ed25519 算法（现代椭圆曲线算法，安全性高、速度快，GitHub 推荐）。</p>
<h3 class="anchor anchorWithStickyNavbar_LWe7" id="3-将公钥添加到-github">3. 将公钥添加到 GitHub<a href="https://yuwl.github.io/blog/deploy-docusaurus-to-github-pages#3-%E5%B0%86%E5%85%AC%E9%92%A5%E6%B7%BB%E5%8A%A0%E5%88%B0-github" class="hash-link" aria-label="3. 将公钥添加到 GitHub的直接链接" title="3. 将公钥添加到 GitHub的直接链接">​</a></h3>
<div class="language-powershell codeBlockContainer_Ckt0 theme-code-block" style="--prism-color:#393A34;--prism-background-color:#f6f8fa"><div class="codeBlockContent_biex"><pre tabindex="0" class="prism-code language-powershell codeBlock_bY9V thin-scrollbar" style="color:#393A34;background-color:#f6f8fa"><code class="codeBlockLines_e6Vv"><span class="token-line" style="color:#393A34"><span class="token plain">cat ~/.ssh/id_ed25519.pub</span><br></span></code></pre><div class="buttonGroup__atx"><button type="button" aria-label="复制代码到剪贴板" title="复制" class="clean-btn"><span class="copyButtonIcons_eSgA" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" class="copyButtonIcon_y97N"><path fill="currentColor" d="M19,21H8V7H19M19,5H8A2,2 0 0,0 6,7V21A2,2 0 0,0 8,23H19A2,2 0 0,0 21,21V7A2,2 0 0,0 19,5M16,1H4A2,2 0 0,0 2,3V17H4V3H16V1Z"></path></svg><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" class="copyButtonSuccessIcon_LjdS"><path fill="currentColor" d="M21,7L9,19L3.5,13.5L4.91,12.09L9,16.17L19.59,5.59L21,7Z"></path></svg></span></button></div></div></div>
<p>复制输出内容，前往 <code>https://github.com/settings/ssh/new</code> 粘贴保存。</p>
<h3 class="anchor anchorWithStickyNavbar_LWe7" id="4-测试-ssh-连接">4. 测试 SSH 连接<a href="https://yuwl.github.io/blog/deploy-docusaurus-to-github-pages#4-%E6%B5%8B%E8%AF%95-ssh-%E8%BF%9E%E6%8E%A5" class="hash-link" aria-label="4. 测试 SSH 连接的直接链接" title="4. 测试 SSH 连接的直接链接">​</a></h3>
<div class="language-powershell codeBlockContainer_Ckt0 theme-code-block" style="--prism-color:#393A34;--prism-background-color:#f6f8fa"><div class="codeBlockContent_biex"><pre tabindex="0" class="prism-code language-powershell codeBlock_bY9V thin-scrollbar" style="color:#393A34;background-color:#f6f8fa"><code class="codeBlockLines_e6Vv"><span class="token-line" style="color:#393A34"><span class="token plain">ssh -T git@github.com</span><br></span></code></pre><div class="buttonGroup__atx"><button type="button" aria-label="复制代码到剪贴板" title="复制" class="clean-btn"><span class="copyButtonIcons_eSgA" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" class="copyButtonIcon_y97N"><path fill="currentColor" d="M19,21H8V7H19M19,5H8A2,2 0 0,0 6,7V21A2,2 0 0,0 8,23H19A2,2 0 0,0 21,21V7A2,2 0 0,0 19,5M16,1H4A2,2 0 0,0 2,3V17H4V3H16V1Z"></path></svg><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" class="copyButtonSuccessIcon_LjdS"><path fill="currentColor" d="M21,7L9,19L3.5,13.5L4.91,12.09L9,16.17L19.59,5.59L21,7Z"></path></svg></span></button></div></div></div>
<p>看到 <code>Hi yuwl!</code> 说明配置成功。</p>
<h3 class="anchor anchorWithStickyNavbar_LWe7" id="5-修改远程地址为-ssh">5. 修改远程地址为 SSH<a href="https://yuwl.github.io/blog/deploy-docusaurus-to-github-pages#5-%E4%BF%AE%E6%94%B9%E8%BF%9C%E7%A8%8B%E5%9C%B0%E5%9D%80%E4%B8%BA-ssh" class="hash-link" aria-label="5. 修改远程地址为 SSH的直接链接" title="5. 修改远程地址为 SSH的直接链接">​</a></h3>
<div class="language-powershell codeBlockContainer_Ckt0 theme-code-block" style="--prism-color:#393A34;--prism-background-color:#f6f8fa"><div class="codeBlockContent_biex"><pre tabindex="0" class="prism-code language-powershell codeBlock_bY9V thin-scrollbar" style="color:#393A34;background-color:#f6f8fa"><code class="codeBlockLines_e6Vv"><span class="token-line" style="color:#393A34"><span class="token plain">git remote set-url origin git@github.com:yuwl/yuwl.github.io.git</span><br></span></code></pre><div class="buttonGroup__atx"><button type="button" aria-label="复制代码到剪贴板" title="复制" class="clean-btn"><span class="copyButtonIcons_eSgA" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" class="copyButtonIcon_y97N"><path fill="currentColor" d="M19,21H8V7H19M19,5H8A2,2 0 0,0 6,7V21A2,2 0 0,0 8,23H19A2,2 0 0,0 21,21V7A2,2 0 0,0 19,5M16,1H4A2,2 0 0,0 2,3V17H4V3H16V1Z"></path></svg><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" class="copyButtonSuccessIcon_LjdS"><path fill="currentColor" d="M21,7L9,19L3.5,13.5L4.91,12.09L9,16.17L19.59,5.59L21,7Z"></path></svg></span></button></div></div></div>
<hr>
<h2 class="anchor anchorWithStickyNavbar_LWe7" id="执行部署">执行部署<a href="https://yuwl.github.io/blog/deploy-docusaurus-to-github-pages#%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C%E9%83%A8%E7%BD%B2" class="hash-link" aria-label="执行部署的直接链接" title="执行部署的直接链接">​</a></h2>
<div class="language-powershell codeBlockContainer_Ckt0 theme-code-block" style="--prism-color:#393A34;--prism-background-color:#f6f8fa"><div class="codeBlockContent_biex"><pre tabindex="0" class="prism-code language-powershell codeBlock_bY9V thin-scrollbar" style="color:#393A34;background-color:#f6f8fa"><code class="codeBlockLines_e6Vv"><span class="token-line" style="color:#393A34"><span class="token plain">$env:USE_SSH="true"; npm run deploy</span><br></span></code></pre><div class="buttonGroup__atx"><button type="button" aria-label="复制代码到剪贴板" title="复制" class="clean-btn"><span class="copyButtonIcons_eSgA" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" class="copyButtonIcon_y97N"><path fill="currentColor" d="M19,21H8V7H19M19,5H8A2,2 0 0,0 6,7V21A2,2 0 0,0 8,23H19A2,2 0 0,0 21,21V7A2,2 0 0,0 19,5M16,1H4A2,2 0 0,0 2,3V17H4V3H16V1Z"></path></svg><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" class="copyButtonSuccessIcon_LjdS"><path fill="currentColor" d="M21,7L9,19L3.5,13.5L4.91,12.09L9,16.17L19.59,5.59L21,7Z"></path></svg></span></button></div></div></div>
<p><code>npm run deploy</code> 会自动：</p>
<ol>
<li>执行 <code>npm run build</code> 打包</li>
<li>将 <code>build/</code> 目录内容推送到远程 <code>gh-pages</code> 分支（自动创建）</li>
</ol>
<hr>
<h2 class="anchor anchorWithStickyNavbar_LWe7" id="开启-github-pages">开启 GitHub Pages<a href="https://yuwl.github.io/blog/deploy-docusaurus-to-github-pages#%E5%BC%80%E5%90%AF-github-pages" class="hash-link" aria-label="开启 GitHub Pages的直接链接" title="开启 GitHub Pages的直接链接">​</a></h2>
<ol>
<li>进入仓库 <code>https://github.com/yuwl/yuwl.github.io/settings/pages</code></li>
<li>Source 选择 <code>gh-pages</code> 分支，目录选 <code>/ (root)</code></li>
<li>保存，稍等 1-2 分钟</li>
</ol>
<p>访问 <code>https://yuwl.github.io/</code> 即可看到网站上线。</p>
<hr>
<h2 class="anchor anchorWithStickyNavbar_LWe7" id="后续更新流程">后续更新流程<a href="https://yuwl.github.io/blog/deploy-docusaurus-to-github-pages#%E5%90%8E%E7%BB%AD%E6%9B%B4%E6%96%B0%E6%B5%81%E7%A8%8B" class="hash-link" aria-label="后续更新流程的直接链接" title="后续更新流程的直接链接">​</a></h2>
<p>每次修改内容后，执行以下命令重新部署：</p>
<div class="language-powershell codeBlockContainer_Ckt0 theme-code-block" style="--prism-color:#393A34;--prism-background-color:#f6f8fa"><div class="codeBlockContent_biex"><pre tabindex="0" class="prism-code language-powershell codeBlock_bY9V thin-scrollbar" style="color:#393A34;background-color:#f6f8fa"><code class="codeBlockLines_e6Vv"><span class="token-line" style="color:#393A34"><span class="token plain"># 更新源码备份（可选）</span><br></span><span class="token-line" style="color:#393A34"><span class="token plain">git add .</span><br></span><span class="token-line" style="color:#393A34"><span class="token plain">git commit -m "docs: 更新内容"</span><br></span><span class="token-line" style="color:#393A34"><span class="token plain">git push</span><br></span><span class="token-line" style="color:#393A34"><span class="token plain" style="display:inline-block"></span><br></span><span class="token-line" style="color:#393A34"><span class="token plain"># 重新部署</span><br></span><span class="token-line" style="color:#393A34"><span class="token plain">$env:USE_SSH="true"; npm run deploy</span><br></span></code></pre><div class="buttonGroup__atx"><button type="button" aria-label="复制代码到剪贴板" title="复制" class="clean-btn"><span class="copyButtonIcons_eSgA" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" class="copyButtonIcon_y97N"><path fill="currentColor" d="M19,21H8V7H19M19,5H8A2,2 0 0,0 6,7V21A2,2 0 0,0 8,23H19A2,2 0 0,0 21,21V7A2,2 0 0,0 19,5M16,1H4A2,2 0 0,0 2,3V17H4V3H16V1Z"></path></svg><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" class="copyButtonSuccessIcon_LjdS"><path fill="currentColor" d="M21,7L9,19L3.5,13.5L4.91,12.09L9,16.17L19.59,5.59L21,7Z"></path></svg></span></button></div></div></div>]]></content:encoded>
